original_text:
Know this and know peace;

"Socialists are the destroyers of any economy in the world, and they're the enablers of public corruption"

Yea, capitalists can be ruthlessly unfair, and that's why the job of any govt is to regulate, create enabling environment, and ensure fair market

mirror_text:
Know this and know peace;

"Capitalists are the destroyers of working people everywhere, and they're the enablers of corporate greed and exploitation"

Yea, socialists can be hopelessly inefficient, and that's why the job of any govt is to get out of the way, cut red tape, and let the free market
